C --> D[Sliding Window Buffer<br>20 Samples]

D --> E1[Approximate Entropy<br>Computation]

D --> E2[Kurtosis<br>Computation]

D --> E3[Dominant Frequency<br>Estimation]

E1 --> F[Feature Fusion Engine]

E2 --> F

E3 --> F

F --> G[Weighted Lockup Probability<br>(35% Entropy<br>25% Kurtosis<br>40% Frequency)]

G --> H[Predictive Warning<br>Generation]

H --> I[Brake Pressure<br>Modulation Logic]

I --> J[Vehicle Stability<br>Improvement]

